From 79617263e3237d45d285ad8bbe4a2019c60d81da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:54:50 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(sim): name rapid contact with the part

Distinguish part-solid rapid collisions from rapid travel through stock.
Keep move locations and blocking diagnostics on MCP and UI surfaces.
Pin all three part-solid rapid branches and retain the stock message.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3520
